{"reviews":[{"id":"B07VKZYXYJ-0","r":5.0,"t":"Very good quality","x":"Very unique, looks hand made in love with these earring, good quality and very durable.","h":12,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B07VKZYXYJ-1","r":5.0,"t":"Super cute!","x":"Great! Sometimes the earring backs that come with it gets stuck but I just started using old earring backs instead and have had no more issues. I think the quality of these are good and for an amazing price!!","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B07VKZYXYJ-2","r":5.0,"t":"Love the variety","x":"Love theses great price all cam intact no issues came on time","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B07VKZYXYJ-3","r":5.0,"t":"Great value!!","x":"I can\u2019t believe I got all these earrings for that cheap. I\u2019ve worn a couple already and they are light weight (I forget I\u2019m even wearing them) and well made. I highly recommend. They come individually wrapped so would be great Christmas stocking stuffers. I love all the colors and small details to them.","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B07VKZYXYJ-4","r":5.0,"t":"Love these fringe earrings!","x":"Love this set! Cute, light and well made. They seem to be holding up well after many wears. I was pleasantly surprised! Great find!","h":9,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B07VKZYXYJ-5","r":5.0,"t":"Cute and colorful","x":"I love the vibrance and the variety of colors in this set. They\u2019re good quality and comfortable to wear.","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B07VKZYXYJ-6","r":5.0,"t":"Great value","x":"LOVED THEM. I wore many of them during my vacation time in Mexico. Nice, durable and beautiful.","h":9,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B07VKZYXYJ-7","r":5.0,"t":"Great earrings","x":"Great earrings for a great cost. Shared with my daughter and daughter in law.","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07VKZYXYJ-8","r":5.0,"t":"Definitely great for gifting!!","x":"Great colors and I loved how each pair is seperately packaged!","h":9,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B07VKZYXYJ-9","r":4.0,"t":"Good","x":"The long ones were beautful, others okay. For the money, they were fine.","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07VKZYXYJ-10","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect for teenager","x":"I love that they are individually wrapped. I could give them to more than one person. My granddaughter will love these Christmas.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B07VKZYXYJ-11","r":5.0,"t":"Nice","x":"These are perfect for the summer, if I can get out this summer. \ud83e\udd14","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B07VKZYXYJ-12","r":5.0,"t":"Not bad.","x":"I order two packs of these by mistake so I'm saving the 2nd pack for christmas gifts.  The longer tassel drop and hoop tassel earrings are beautiful.  The shorter ones were smushed. So I probably wont be wearing then if they do not fluff out. I wonder if they will go back to normal if I wet them. However. I'm satisfied with my order.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B07VKZYXYJ-13","r":4.0,"t":"Fun earrings","x":"You get a lot of earrings for this price!!!! They are not made really well, but I didn't expect the best quality for the price.  What I liked are the variety of colors and styles, they make an outfit fun :)","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B07VKZYXYJ-14","r":5.0,"t":"Definitely worth the money!","x":"So I went to a baby shower and the theme was \"shades of blue.\" Of course I waited till the last minute to find an outfit and accessories, but I found this pack and they had several blue options and the day was saved! Hey am I going to wear white earrings everyday- nope. Turquoise blue ones, nope again. But thats what is so great about this purchase, you don't have to feel guilty if you don't wear one or two colors, or you can even give them away as gifts, since the price point is so perfect.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B07VKZYXYJ-15","r":5.0,"t":"Love these!","x":"If your looking for some stylish, lightweight earrings, look no further! These are incredibly light weight and will not weigh down your ears. So many color options for different outfits. These would also make great gifts. They came well packaged. I\u2019m extremely pleased! Highly recommend!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07VKZYXYJ-16","r":4.0,"t":"Nice Variety and Value","x":"The variety and value are unbeatable. I especially like the flexibility in being able to cut the tassels to your desired length. Only downside to me is that the tassel strings are so, so, so lightweight that they don't move. The earrings are stiff and are not flowy strings like you would expect with normal tassels. I still receive compliments when I wear them, though. They're the type of items that look good from afar. Just don't touch them.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B07VKZYXYJ-17","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful!","x":"First of all, they're a great value for the money. They are light weight, and because of the way they're organized (as shown on the pic) they're giftable. I will cover the golden parts with transparent nail polish because I don't know if the color will fade, and I don't want to risk it. This year I will continue teaching online, so I wanted cool statement earrings, and these are just perfect. \u2764\ufe0f","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B07VKZYXYJ-18","r":3.0,"t":"Good for the money if you want TASSEL Earrings for an outfit","x":"Good collection if you are looking for tassel earrings.  I did not rate a 5 as the black tassel, which I had wanted particularly, arrived without a post. Otherwise, for the money, you get a variety of colors and designs.  Most I do not like but my daughter-in-laws and granddaughters seemed to like for a fun option. Do like that can trim the tassels for your preference.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B07VKZYXYJ-19","r":2.0,"t":"Get what you pay for!","x":"You get several pairs for the money but this is one of those times where you defiantly get what you pay for. I received a couple pairs that were the same in the group so that was a waste and they are pretty cheaply made. The metal is flimsy and the tassels are thin threads so they don\u2019t stay nice and straight. I havent actually worn any yet.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B07VKZYXYJ-20","r":5.0,"t":"Great Set!","x":"I was really surprised with the quality of these earrings. So many styles and colors you can with them with anything!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B07VKZYXYJ-21","r":5.0,"t":"Super pleased with my purchase!","x":"Great quality for the value!! These are super cute and would even make great gifts!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B07VKZYXYJ-22","r":3.0,"t":"Metal studs are not filed properly","x":"Metal parts/ Studs are not hypo allergenic.  Very delicate. Can easily break.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07VKZYXYJ-23","r":5.0,"t":"Love thr.","x":"Great variety of colors and styles good value for the money","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B07VKZYXYJ-24","r":1.0,"t":"Not a fan","x":"Extremely cheap and tacky looking. Would not recommend.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Oct 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the earrings as great value for the price, noting the large quantity received for the cost.","cites":[2,3,4,7,8,14]},{"text":"Many customers describe the earrings as cute, colorful, and offering good variety in colors and styles.","cites":[4,6,9,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers highlight the quality as good, well made, and durable.","cites":[1,2,4,5,7]},{"text":"Multiple customers appreciate that each pair is individually wrapped, making them great for gifting.","cites":[4,9,11]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention issues with earring backs getting stuck or some shorter earrings arriving smushed, and one notes they are not made really well.","cites":[2,13,14]}]},"qa":[]}